{"answer":"Approved PRs for CRM integration features in CoachForce (formerly CoFoAIX):

1. **Salesforce CRM Integration Endpoint** (approved & merged) – https://github.com/salesforce/CoFoAIX/pull/2

Note: The **HubSpot CRM Integration Endpoint** PR (https://github.com/salesforce/CoFoAIX/pull/6) had changes requested (not approved) and was not merged; a later related PR (https://github.com/salesforce/CoFoAIX/pull/10) was approved by the team in chat, though no formal review record is provided for it."}

